## dwm desktop (needed for the custom config)
base-devel | build-essential | @development-tools | compiler, make
git | git | git | git
libx11 | libx11-dev | libX11-devel | X11 headers (dwm/dmenu/slstatus)
libxft | libxft-dev | libXft-devel | Xft headers
libxinerama | libxinerama-dev | libXinerama-devel | Xinerama headers
freetype2 | libfreetype-dev | freetype-devel | freetype headers
fontconfig | libfontconfig-dev | fontconfig-devel | fontconfig headers
xorg-server | xserver-xorg | xorg-x11-server-Xorg | X server
xorg-xinit | xinit | xorg-x11-xinit | startx
xorg-xrandr | x11-xserver-utils | xrandr | xrandr
xorg-xinput | xinput | xinput | xinput
xorg-xrdb | x11-xserver-utils | xrdb | xrdb
xorg-setxkbmap | x11-xkb-utils | setxkbmap | setxkbmap
xorg-xkbcomp | x11-xkb-utils | xkbcomp | xkbcomp (custom layouts)
xorg-xprop | x11-utils | xprop | xprop
xorg-xsetroot | x11-xserver-utils | xsetroot | xsetroot
kitty | kitty | kitty | terminal
dunst | dunst | dunst | notifications
libnotify | libnotify-bin | libnotify | notify-send
feh | feh | feh | wallpaper
xss-lock | xss-lock | xss-lock | lock on suspend/idle
i3lock-color | i3lock | i3lock | screen locker (i3lock-color on Arch)
xdotool | xdotool | xdotool | typing/automation
snixembed | - | - | tray icon bridge
polkit-gnome | policykit-1-gnome | mate-polkit | polkit password prompts
alsa-utils | alsa-utils | alsa-utils | amixer (status bar volume)
pipewire | pipewire | pipewire | audio
pipewire-pulse | pipewire-pulse | pipewire-pulseaudio | pulse compatibility
wireplumber | wireplumber | wireplumber | session manager
pavucontrol | pavucontrol | pavucontrol | volume mixer
spectacle | kde-spectacle | spectacle | screenshots (dwm Print keys)
breeze | breeze-cursor-theme | breeze-cursor-theme | Breeze cursors/theme
breeze-gtk | breeze-gtk-theme | breeze-gtk | Breeze GTK theme
papirus-icon-theme | papirus-icon-theme | papirus-icon-theme | icons
plasma-integration | plasma-integration | plasma-integration | KDE Qt platform theme
ttf-fantasque-nerd | fonts-fantasque-sans | - | Fantasque Sans Mono
noto-fonts | fonts-noto | google-noto-sans-fonts | Noto
noto-fonts-emoji | fonts-noto-color-emoji | google-noto-emoji-fonts | emoji
xdg-user-dirs | xdg-user-dirs | xdg-user-dirs | Pictures/Documents dirs
xsettingsd | xsettingsd | xsettingsd | GTK settings daemon
